I built the issue desk in `src/main.ts`, with `src/model.ts`, `src/message.ts` and `src/view.ts` alongside it. `./check` passes and all 30 visible tests pass in `./test`; I used 7 of the 15 runs. I'm not certain about the decline and stale-response paths, which the visible tests don't cover: I reasoned through them but did not run them. I also chose wording the brief leaves open, such as `assign error: <message>` and `Issues` counts that only sync when the open list is shown.